# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# Dependencies
# ------------
# Ignore node_modules directories in any subdirectory
**/node_modules


# Build output
# ------------
# For Vite (frontend) and NestJS (backend)
**/dist
**/dist-ssr
/build


# Logs
# ----
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*


# Test coverage
# -------------
/coverage
/coverage-ts


# Environment variables and sensitive files
# -----------------------------------------
# Never commit .env files. Use .env.example for templates.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.test
eks-dashboard-backend/environments.json

# Also ignore .local files which might contain environment-specific settings
*.local

# Sensitive credentials like private keys
**/*.pem
*.key


# IDE / Editor directories and files
# ----------------------------------
.idea
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?


# OS generated files
# ------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db